ortant is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}, {"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "engenn6le09ob05re7pdf01.pdf"}], "type": "question"}]}], "type": "DWS", "id": 11, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " It's time for a business meeting!"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n"}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le09ob05re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le09ob05re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le09ob05re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le09ob05re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Thanks for coming, Mr. Farmani. We're here to discuss and announce our plans for Holly's. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Before you move on, is this going to be long?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Not at all. We just have a few things on the agenda. Has everyone got a copy of the agenda? First, we'll address our media plan. Secondly, we have the publicity plan for the new clothing line. Finally, we'll round it off with any questions you may have, Mr. Farmani. Is there anything else you would like to add to the agenda?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: No. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I don't think so."}, {"time": "30000", "image": "engenn6le09ob05re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: So, I would like to start things off by telling you that our Press Office will not focus on managing \u2018traditional' media. In other words, we intend to direct our attention to \u2018new' media, such as Holly's website, internet articles, blogs, social media platforms. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Sorry for interrupting, but how will that help my company sell more clothes? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: That's a good question. The future of sales and publicity is going to be through social media - Mebook, Photogram, etc. This will definitely help boost sales, raise brand awareness ..."}, {"time": "63200", "image": "engenn6le09ob05re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Can I stop you there for a second? The Garcias have offered something similar and better. They have their own web portal \u2026 <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: If I could just come in here, I'm not sure how this is going to increase sales. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: As I was saying, they are offering not only business-to-consumer sales, but also business-to-business sales, which means other retail stores will be able to sell Holly's new clothing line."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Fighting the Competition"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Meeting"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Grammar - part 1 > Living Longer and Better"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 9}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le09ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Language for Managing a Meeting"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " The language of meetings is central to business communication. Whether you are holding a meeting or attending one, it is important that you use and understand key language and expressions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When people get together to talk about important things and make important decisions, they usually have a \u2018meeting'. Here are some more common patterns:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>A meeting on / about: <br/><span class =\"italic\">We are having a meeting on our marketing issues.</span></li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>A meeting with:<br/><span class =\"italic\">That's a point I would like to address during my meeting with Mr. Farmani.</span></li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>Hold a meeting:<br/><span class =\"italic\">We're holding a meeting next week to discuss our new marketing strategy.</span></li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>Attend a meeting:<br/><span class =\"italic\">Is Farmani attending our meeting on branding?</span></li></ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Opening the meeting</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Introducing items on the agenda</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>I'd like to welcome everyone to the meeting.</li><li>Thank you all for making it at such short notice.</li><li>Shall we make a start?</li><li>Let's get down to business.</li><li>Has everyone got a copy of the agenda?</li><li>We're here to discuss \u2026</li><li>The objective of this meeting is to ... </li></ul></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>The first item on the agenda is ...</li><li>The first thing we need to look at is ...</li><li>The first thing we need to decide on is \u2026</li><li>Now I'd like us to turn to the next point on the agenda.</li><li>First, ...</li><li>Secondly, \u2026</li><li>Finally, we'll round it off with any questions you may have ...</li></ul></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Welcoming participation</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Closing the meeting</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>Is there anything else you would like to add to the agenda?</li><li>Do you have any ideas, Adriana?</li><li>Do you have any suggestions, Maria?</li><li>I'd like to hear your thoughts on this, Carol.</li><li>What do you think about that, Mark?</li></ul></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>I think that this pretty much brings us to the end of our meeting.</li><li>So, I'd like to run briefly through all the points we've discussed.</li><li>Thank you all for your contribution to this meeting.</li><li>Thank you all for attending today.</li></ul></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Thanks for coming, Ms. Morehouse."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We're here to discuss our plans for the future of this company."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The first item on the agenda is our SWOT analysis."}, {"type": "example", "content": "First, we'll address our marketing plan."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Secondly, we have the charity events for the clothing line."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Finally, we'll round it off with any questions you may have."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Is there anything else you would like to add to the agenda?"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Language for Interrupting"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "In a meeting, sometimes you want to stop someone when they are speaking or concentrating on something, to say something you consider important. Here are some ways to interrupt politely:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class =\"italic\"><ul><li>Sorry for interrupting, but  \u2026</li><li>Excuse me for butting in, but \u2026</li><li>Can I stop you there for a second?</li><li>Can I just say something here?</li><li>Can I just mention something?</li><li>Before you move on, \u2026</li><li>If I could just come in here.</li></ul></span>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to round off"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to close a meeting with a last item on the agenda"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We'll round off the meeting with any questions you may have. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob05aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use in business meetings."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to intend"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to have a course of action as one's purpose or objective"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We intend to conclude the meeting by 12 p.m."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob05aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to direct"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to aim or focus attention"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We intend to direct our attention to \u2018new' media, such as websites, blogs and social media platforms."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob05aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to boost"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to encourage something to improve"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Social media will definitely help boost sales."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob05aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to raise"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to move to a higher position or level"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: To raise brand awareness, try using social media."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob05aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to increase"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make greater in amount or size"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Creating a company website is going to increase sales."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob05aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "retail store"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a store that sells goods to the public"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We're going to offer our new clothing line in other retail stores."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob05aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue between two people at a business meeting."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The meeting is about the company trying to sell a new product. You can choose the product."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use expressions to manage the meeting and interrupt politely."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice your dialogue aloud with a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue about a business meeting."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use expressions to manage a meeting."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use expressions to interrupt politely."}]}]}